  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your eidolon is more advanced than others.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Extra Evolution<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your eidolon gains 1 additional evolution point. In addition, each time you summon your eidolon you can grant it a number of additional evolution points equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) by expending an equal number of uses of you mythic power.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-extra-feats#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
